WEBVTT

00:04.160 --> 00:08.820
By the way, Aria said that she was
in the Cinderella Star event too, right?

00:09.670 --> 00:11.280
But why didn't we notice

00:11.280 --> 00:13.870
someone as beautiful as her?

00:14.990 --> 00:18.620
There was no other topic from that day
other than Lilysa and the others.

00:19.030 --> 00:20.500
Maybe she picked a bad spot?

00:20.500 --> 00:22.210
Sorry for the wait!

00:22.210 --> 00:23.250
So fast!

00:25.080 --> 00:26.630
Tadaa!

00:29.630 --> 00:30.090
BAFFLED

00:30.090 --> 00:31.190
BAFFLED
Who?

00:31.190 --> 00:34.330
BAFFLED
Umm... This is from the Princess Channel...

00:34.330 --> 00:35.390
BAFFLED
Pearl, I think?

00:35.390 --> 00:38.750
It's Princess Chanel!
And how can you say you're Pearl?!

00:38.750 --> 00:41.120
Your hairstyle, hair color,
and costume are different!

00:41.120 --> 00:42.820
And you didn't even change your makeup!

00:42.820 --> 00:44.920
What? Wasn't she looking like this?

00:44.920 --> 00:47.340
Blonde ponytail and black swimsuit...

00:47.340 --> 00:49.450
Pearl doesn't have blonde hair!

00:49.450 --> 00:51.990
She has an inferiority complex
because of her red hair!

00:51.990 --> 00:53.580
Is that so? I don't know much,

00:53.580 --> 00:54.120
but she's from the popular anime, right?

00:54.120 --> 00:55.260
ARGH!
but she's from the popular anime, right?

00:55.260 --> 00:56.670
ARGH!
And I heard that it's easier to get famous

00:56.670 --> 00:58.330
- She doesn't have a ponytail too!
- by cosplaying a popular character.

00:58.330 --> 01:00.420
AAGGHHH
Her cosplay is just way too careless!

01:00.420 --> 01:04.460
AAGGHHH
Give me back all the sympathy I had just now!

01:05.060 --> 01:06.170
Hey, Lilie—

01:09.770 --> 01:10.880
Aria...

01:11.200 --> 01:11.970
Yes?!

01:14.750 --> 01:16.220
It's such a waste!

01:17.000 --> 01:17.620
Eh?

01:18.380 --> 01:21.850
Cosplay is much more fun than that!

01:25.980 --> 01:30.650
2.5 DIMENSIONAL SEDUCTION

02:53.030 --> 02:58.030
#16 MY WAY OF DOING THINGS

02:58.030 --> 03:01.450
She doesn't have a ponytail!
Your cosplay is just way too careless!

03:01.450 --> 03:05.720
- Give me back all the sympathy I had just now!
- Is it a bad idea that I brought

03:05.720 --> 03:07.380
a stranger out of the blue?

03:08.000 --> 03:12.690
It's an artisanship that transforms
2D information into 3D form!

03:12.690 --> 03:14.980
The groove of becoming
your beloved character!

03:14.980 --> 03:16.090
Groove?

03:16.090 --> 03:18.340
The happiness of the hard work...

03:18.340 --> 03:22.140
...after delivering that
character to the fans!

03:22.140 --> 03:23.060
Happiness?

03:23.420 --> 03:25.270
Aria, you're a diamond in the rough!

03:25.580 --> 03:28.520
With your face and style,
you can cosplay any character you want!

03:28.850 --> 03:31.830
You have endless possibilities, but...

03:32.700 --> 03:35.490
Ah, Aria... Please...

03:35.490 --> 03:37.490
I don't mind if it's only once...

03:37.850 --> 03:40.700
Would you try my way of cosplaying?!

03:42.310 --> 03:45.000
I'm sure it'll make you shine, Aria!

03:52.700 --> 03:55.840
I'll be in your care!

03:58.200 --> 04:01.010
Let's start with 1,000 famous anime series.

04:01.010 --> 04:03.490
Let's watch all the late-night
anime of this season!

04:03.490 --> 04:05.530
Huh? But I have to sleep at night...

04:05.530 --> 04:08.530
It's an easy thing to push anyone
down to the rabbit hole, you know?

04:08.530 --> 04:09.400
Rabbit hole?

04:09.400 --> 04:12.180
Yes. It's really okay if you fell
into the rabbit hole.

04:12.180 --> 04:14.000
Sorry, Nonoa.

04:14.000 --> 04:16.890
She can't be stopped once
she talks about the things she loves.

04:17.270 --> 04:18.790
I know.

04:18.790 --> 04:21.910
I'm sure that's exactly why I like her.

04:22.790 --> 04:25.080
You were brave enough
to start cosplaying.

04:25.580 --> 04:28.880
That alone makes us friends.

04:29.670 --> 04:31.030
Please...

04:31.460 --> 04:32.710
Please be my friend.

04:32.710 --> 04:35.460
Yes! Of course!

04:36.180 --> 04:38.740
I'm the one who was accepted by her.

04:39.070 --> 04:41.280
So I don't have the right
to say no to other people.

04:41.710 --> 04:44.160
If we like the same things,

04:44.680 --> 04:47.840
we might be able to understand each other.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.640
I'll be in your care too, Nonopi!

04:50.640 --> 04:52.090
Stop calling me that!

04:52.090 --> 04:54.570
And don't get too close to Liliel!

04:54.570 --> 04:55.140
WOMEN'S LOCKER - MAKEUP ROOM

04:55.140 --> 04:58.390
WOMEN'S LOCKER - MAKEUP ROOM
But I can't like her right now.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.260
WOMEN'S LOCKER - MAKEUP ROOM

04:59.260 --> 05:03.630
Hey, can I get a good look at your
costumes before you change?

05:03.630 --> 05:05.970
If it's for research purposes, by all means!

05:05.970 --> 05:08.190
If Lilysa says so...

05:08.190 --> 05:09.290
Yaay!

05:10.580 --> 05:12.120
Are those breasts real?

05:12.120 --> 05:12.930
Yes.

05:12.930 --> 05:14.230
Can I touch them?

05:14.230 --> 05:15.490
Of course not!

05:15.490 --> 05:16.440
Sure.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.260
What?!

05:17.540 --> 05:22.040
I hate if people thought that it's only
a cosplay the moment they touched my breasts,

05:22.040 --> 05:26.220
so I'm aiming for a perfect costume
that looks real even if you touch it.

05:26.650 --> 05:28.310
Now, if you'll excuse me...

05:28.850 --> 05:30.470
Don't touch them!

05:30.470 --> 05:31.910
Eh? But Lilysa said it's fine...

05:31.910 --> 05:34.020
She's talking about the costume!

05:34.020 --> 05:35.850
I-It's alright.

05:35.850 --> 05:38.190
Sorry, you're just so cute...

05:38.510 --> 05:40.460
You want to touch them too, right?

05:40.460 --> 05:41.240
Huh?!

05:41.620 --> 05:42.220
No...

05:43.180 --> 05:45.780
Nonoa, you want to touch them too?

05:45.780 --> 05:46.660
Eh?

05:59.510 --> 06:02.080
Does it feel like the real Liliel?

06:02.080 --> 06:03.470
Y-Yes...

06:03.470 --> 06:06.490
Soft and pillowy like
marshmallows or steamed buns...

06:06.490 --> 06:07.770
It was angelic...

06:08.190 --> 06:09.390
Angelic?

06:10.760 --> 06:12.100
How nice.

06:12.880 --> 06:13.690
Huh?

06:13.690 --> 06:17.360
Well, both of you have bodies
like in the manga.

06:17.360 --> 06:18.850
I'm so jealous.

06:18.850 --> 06:20.780
Compared to that, I'm so skinny...

06:21.090 --> 06:22.030
That's not true!

06:22.030 --> 06:25.390
I admire your slim and slender body,
which is just like in the manga!

06:25.760 --> 06:30.120
I'm short, chubby,
and disproportionate for my height.

06:30.500 --> 06:33.120
What?! Isn't that what makes you cute?!

06:33.120 --> 06:37.440
That's right. My body is lean and kind
of muscular, which is not a feminine look.

06:37.440 --> 06:39.880
Eh?! Isn't that what makes you stylish?!

06:40.220 --> 06:43.240
Lilysa is very soft, while Nonopi is slim.

06:43.240 --> 06:45.340
It's making me jealous.

06:48.110 --> 06:50.680
The grass is always greener
on the other side, huh...

06:51.260 --> 06:53.920
There's no such thing as a perfect body.

06:54.310 --> 06:58.480
But in cosplay, we have the freedom
to make any adjustments we want!

06:58.480 --> 07:01.030
That's why I think it's so great!

07:01.880 --> 07:05.860
That's true. I don't worry much
about it when I'm doing cosplay.

07:07.060 --> 07:09.820
I'm sorry I barged in so suddenly today.

07:09.820 --> 07:11.950
No, no, it's fine.

07:11.950 --> 07:15.480
Oh, right! Would you like to come
visit our club next time?

07:15.480 --> 07:17.530
Are you sure?! I'm in!

07:20.540 --> 07:21.230
MANGA CLUB

07:21.230 --> 07:22.000
MANGA CLUB
Well then!

07:23.790 --> 07:26.130
We'll do our first anime
watching party today.

07:26.130 --> 07:28.970
With the goal to push
Aria down the rabbit hole!

07:28.970 --> 07:30.810
Let's go!

07:30.810 --> 07:33.340
I'm surprised the principal agreed to this.

07:33.340 --> 07:36.880
I did everything I could when I heard
cute cosplayers would gather here.

07:37.240 --> 07:39.640
I followed the brass band's procedure.

07:40.000 --> 07:40.940
Brass band?

07:42.310 --> 07:45.950
Amano competes at the national level, right?

07:46.290 --> 07:50.260
So it's understandable if she wants
to practice with girls from the same level.

07:50.760 --> 07:52.680
But it's not a competition...

07:52.680 --> 07:55.750
Good luck with the summer tournament!

07:56.160 --> 07:57.450
Does he mean Comiket?!

07:59.100 --> 08:02.420
I'd like to join,
but I have a meeting after this.

08:02.930 --> 08:04.400
Thank you very much.

08:04.400 --> 08:07.680
She's a beginner, right?
Don't be so hard on her.

08:07.680 --> 08:09.560
Yes. You can count on me.

08:10.980 --> 08:14.490
So, Miss Lilysa... What is this about
pushing me down the rabbit hole?

08:14.490 --> 08:16.000
Is it some kind of prank? How scary!

08:16.000 --> 08:18.900
If it was a prank,
we wouldn't have brought you here.

08:18.900 --> 08:21.200
Huh? Ah, I see.

08:22.100 --> 08:23.870
CHATTER CHATTER
Rabbit hole is a metaphor

08:23.870 --> 08:25.980
CHATTER CHATTER
for the bottomless hole of otaku life.

08:25.980 --> 08:27.250
CHATTER CHATTER
It describes an otaku who

08:27.250 --> 08:28.630
CHATTER CHATTER
gets stuck in the depths of lore.

08:28.630 --> 08:30.020
CHATTER CHATTER
The more you struggle,

08:30.020 --> 08:31.410
CHATTER CHATTER
the more your lungs will be filled

08:31.410 --> 08:32.620
CHATTER CHATTER
with contents, and it'll suffocate you.

08:32.620 --> 08:34.560
CHATTER CHATTER
It describes the fate of all otaku.

08:34.560 --> 08:37.200
CHATTER CHATTER
Oh no, it doesn't ease my fears at all...

08:37.560 --> 08:39.350
Is everyone falling into that rabbit hole?

08:39.350 --> 08:40.570
Yep.

08:40.570 --> 08:41.670
Instant answers?!

08:43.260 --> 08:46.380
There's no "the right way" to do cosplay.

08:46.380 --> 08:49.700
So I would like Aria to know the joy

08:49.700 --> 08:53.260
of cosplaying your favorite
character the way I do.

08:53.620 --> 08:56.580
So first, I would like to preach
some good works

08:57.060 --> 08:59.970
and ask her to create her favorite character.

09:01.270 --> 09:03.610
Aren't you just trying
to increase your otaku friends?

09:04.150 --> 09:06.620
And here I'll introduce
to you a special lecturer!

09:06.620 --> 09:07.670
Please come!

09:10.800 --> 09:14.630
Hello, I'm Okumura, and I was in charge
of selecting the contents for today.

09:14.630 --> 09:16.120
Ah, okay.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.890
You're Lilysa's boyfriend, right?

09:19.040 --> 09:20.070
What?!

09:20.070 --> 09:21.130
No, he's not!

09:21.130 --> 09:22.250
What? Really?

09:22.620 --> 09:25.020
Both of you looked like a couple...

09:25.020 --> 09:27.660
So I'm just saying
what everyone's thinking.

09:27.660 --> 09:29.630
I didn't even consider that at all...

09:30.950 --> 09:34.630
I'm all about 2D,
so I can't date 3D girls.

09:34.630 --> 09:38.060
I don't know what he means, but one
thing's for sure, that guy is a lost cause.

09:38.830 --> 09:43.850
And now, I thought we should start
with Liliel's anime.

09:44.320 --> 09:48.610
Senior, it would take four days to watch
the 312 episodes of the main story,

09:48.610 --> 09:49.990
the Ash War Chronicle.

09:49.990 --> 09:53.670
312 episodes?! That's so scary!

09:53.670 --> 09:55.700
And that's with no sleep or breaks.

09:56.700 --> 09:59.970
But there's a spin-off with
Liliel as the main character,

09:59.970 --> 10:01.740
which is basically our bible...

10:01.740 --> 10:04.540
Would it be heresy to start
with the Liliel side story?

10:05.680 --> 10:08.750
As an otaku, I will say one thing.

10:10.400 --> 10:12.680
It doesn't matter where you start!

10:12.680 --> 10:16.230
It'll be such a waste to skip the whole season
just because you missed one episode!

10:16.230 --> 10:18.820
You may buy 6 volumes of a manga
because it has a good cover!

10:18.820 --> 10:21.930
It doesn't matter if you like a series
just because you love the actor!

10:21.930 --> 10:25.260
The side story only has 13 episodes,
and we can finish them in four hours.

10:25.260 --> 10:28.740
Watching anime for 4 hours today?!
Sports clubs don't even practice this long!

10:28.740 --> 10:30.020
There'll be homework, too.

10:30.020 --> 10:31.250
You're a demon...

10:31.250 --> 10:32.780
Don't worry...

10:32.780 --> 10:35.780
Once you start,
you'll be able to go through 40 days

10:35.780 --> 10:37.760
of summer holiday without
eating or drinking.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.910
I'M LOOKING FORWARD TO IT
You're worse than those two...

10:42.490 --> 10:46.880
The action scene in the first episode
is so intense as if it's a movie version.

10:46.880 --> 10:50.690
Please enjoy this work by the nationally
highly acclaimed NAKAMURA production.

10:50.690 --> 10:53.720
I don't understand what you're
talking about. But I'll watch it.

11:00.680 --> 11:03.060
Liliel!

11:03.180 --> 11:07.020
Can't we all just watch it silently? You can't
scream like that even in the cinemas, right?

11:07.620 --> 11:09.420
Ah, sorry about that...

11:09.420 --> 11:10.910
Sorry...

11:20.880 --> 11:24.740
That last line is foreshadowing
the first half of the series...

11:24.740 --> 11:25.960
Oh...

11:27.670 --> 11:29.740
It's not working at all...

11:29.740 --> 11:32.880
Hooking a gyaru on anime
might be harder than we thought...

11:32.880 --> 11:34.770
Maybe we should have picked a love comedy...

11:34.770 --> 11:37.440
Let's believe in Liliel...

11:37.440 --> 11:38.930
Y-Yeah...

11:42.820 --> 11:44.080
Aria...

11:44.630 --> 11:46.460
W-Was that boring?

11:46.460 --> 11:48.220
Huh? It was interesting though.

11:48.220 --> 11:49.780
R-Really?!

11:49.780 --> 11:51.650
But, you see...

11:54.110 --> 11:56.170
We were glued here for hours.

11:56.670 --> 11:58.820
Don't you guys want to hang out outside?

11:58.950 --> 12:00.940
Hang out... Outside...?

12:00.940 --> 12:04.260
Huh? Outside? What? Eh?

12:04.260 --> 12:05.710
Why? Why...?

12:05.710 --> 12:08.460
Are there zombies or something
around your houses?

12:09.040 --> 12:10.580
But, Aria...

12:11.010 --> 12:14.350
If you can't stand to watch
this level of anime,

12:14.350 --> 12:17.440
it's probably impossible for you
to learn cosplay from Lilysa.

12:17.440 --> 12:19.680
Gotta say, it's no problem at all for me.

12:20.020 --> 12:21.120
I can do this!

12:21.680 --> 12:24.230
I really admired Lilysa's passion!

12:24.230 --> 12:27.170
I'm sure that if I trusted what she said,
I wouldn't be mistaken.

12:27.170 --> 12:32.020
This feeling that I want to be the best
cosplayer like Lilysa and Nonoa is genuine!

12:33.500 --> 12:36.240
Why would she go that far
although she's not an otaku?

12:36.560 --> 12:39.070
I'm going to make it through!

12:39.660 --> 12:41.930
- She's grown up so fast.
- We're just watching anime though...

12:44.110 --> 12:45.440
It's over now.

12:51.930 --> 12:53.170
Please run.

12:53.860 --> 12:56.710
I'll stop him here even if it costs my life.

12:57.600 --> 13:00.800
Don't be ridiculous!
We can't sacrifice you and just run away!

13:01.320 --> 13:05.730
Heh, it doesn't sound bad
if I can die together with you all.

13:07.910 --> 13:10.710
What?! It finished already?!

13:10.710 --> 13:14.180
This is getting really exciting!
What's going on?

13:16.370 --> 13:17.460
Guys?

13:18.430 --> 13:21.790
We can't say anything from here on out,
because a single word can be a spoiler!

13:21.790 --> 13:25.060
I want to! But I can't say it!

13:25.060 --> 13:26.490
I-I see...

13:29.180 --> 13:30.210
Liliel!

13:32.460 --> 13:34.670
Ah... No way...

13:34.670 --> 13:35.220
OOOHHH

13:35.220 --> 13:37.420
OOOHHH
How did this happen?

13:37.420 --> 13:39.130
OTAKUS WHO'RE LOOKING FORWARD
TO THE REACTION OF A FIRST-TIME VIEWER

13:42.090 --> 13:45.180
Liliel!

13:45.760 --> 13:47.140
LILIEL SIDE STORY

13:47.140 --> 13:49.260
That was really good!

13:49.260 --> 13:51.430
I'm glad to hear that!

13:51.430 --> 13:55.020
I didn't know that anime could be
so deep and make me cry like this!

13:55.020 --> 13:57.060
I'm glad that it can convey to you.

13:57.060 --> 13:59.820
I thought it would be difficult
for a beginner to watch fantasy.

14:00.400 --> 14:04.480
It reminded me of a manga
I used to read as a kid.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.820
So I feel familiar with it.

14:06.220 --> 14:07.760
That's great.

14:08.140 --> 14:09.830
What kind of manga did she read?

14:10.180 --> 14:14.640
At this rate, we'll watch from
the older series to the currently airing,

14:14.640 --> 14:16.980
so please decide which character
you want to cosplay.

14:16.980 --> 14:19.590
Yes! Miss Lilysa's class is fun!

14:19.710 --> 14:21.770
Yes, it is!

14:21.770 --> 14:24.670
I can't believe I have friends
to hang out with every week...

14:24.670 --> 14:27.100
Watching anime with everyone is so fun...

14:27.520 --> 14:29.540
Don't cry over something like that, Nonopi.

14:29.540 --> 14:31.590
I can go hang out with you anytime.

14:31.590 --> 14:32.850
We're friends, right?

14:32.850 --> 14:33.310
BADUMP
Eh?

14:33.310 --> 14:34.190
MELTS AT THE WORD "FRIENDS"

14:34.190 --> 14:37.190
Anyway, I'm worried about you
because you don't seem to be well,

14:37.190 --> 14:40.830
so let's go sweat with bowling, go all-you
can-eat, and then finish up with karaoke.

14:40.830 --> 14:42.100
I'm gonna die...

14:43.440 --> 14:45.020
See you next time then!

14:45.020 --> 14:46.860
Thank you for today!

14:47.380 --> 14:50.290
Let's go back home together
and hang out in the station, Nonopi.

14:50.290 --> 14:52.960
Just how much stamina do you have...

14:54.670 --> 14:57.380
I don't understand this anime.

14:57.380 --> 14:59.260
But Nonopi can't stop laughing.

14:59.260 --> 15:02.350
It's too meta that you won't
understand it unless you're an otaku.

15:02.350 --> 15:05.510
I guess I'll refrain from telling any
of the latest deep inside jokes.

15:06.050 --> 15:08.850
Pierce through!

15:09.520 --> 15:11.510
Today's anime was interesting.

15:11.510 --> 15:13.200
It's also the first time for me too.

15:13.200 --> 15:15.560
Senior Okumura is really good at picking anime.

15:15.560 --> 15:16.850
Here, your boba.

15:16.850 --> 15:18.700
Eh? That's for me?

15:18.700 --> 15:19.770
I've never had one...

15:19.770 --> 15:20.550
BADUMP BADUMP

15:20.550 --> 15:21.920
BADUMP BADUMP
Thank you.

15:21.920 --> 15:25.240
BADUMP BADUMP

15:27.570 --> 15:31.990
I'm full... My blood sugar is spiking...

15:31.990 --> 15:33.750
But you only took one sip!

15:34.130 --> 15:36.860
Eh? Did I do something wrong again?

15:38.000 --> 15:39.840
Is this a currently airing anime?

15:39.840 --> 15:43.130
Compared to the old anime,
they do have beautiful graphics,

15:43.130 --> 15:44.410
but they don't move very much.

15:44.410 --> 15:46.430
But the story is well written and interesting.

15:46.930 --> 15:50.160
To think that you can
tell the difference now...

15:50.160 --> 15:55.150
That's because all the old ones you've
seen were masterpieces of their era.

15:55.150 --> 15:56.740
Ah, I see.

15:56.740 --> 15:59.900
Besides, the pictures are not the only
thing that makes an anime good.

16:00.490 --> 16:04.730
The settings of the old anime
were unthinkable nowadays,

16:04.730 --> 16:06.950
so there are some out-of-place aspects.

16:06.950 --> 16:09.410
If you see old anime from overseas,
you'll be stunned.

16:09.780 --> 16:11.270
You've watched a lot of anime now.

16:11.270 --> 16:14.160
Is there any character from
any series that you want to pick?

16:15.360 --> 16:17.300
There were a lot of them, but...

16:18.160 --> 16:20.940
LILIEL SIDE STORY
I like the first one most.

16:20.940 --> 16:23.590
LILIEL SIDE STORY
I also got all pumped up from your explanation.

16:23.980 --> 16:25.870
It was worth the effort!

16:25.870 --> 16:27.350
Good for you, Lilysa!

16:27.350 --> 16:28.050
Yes!

16:28.400 --> 16:32.610
And I can do a photo shoot together with
you two if it's from the same work, right?

16:32.610 --> 16:35.770
W-Well, that's true...

16:36.230 --> 16:39.730
So? Which character do you want to cosplay?

16:40.150 --> 16:43.360
Lilysa is Liliel,
and Nonopi is Nokiel, right?

16:43.840 --> 16:45.820
They're from the Angel Airborne Squad, right?

16:45.820 --> 16:49.530
If you want to cosplay Liliel, I don't mind
letting you have it just for once...

16:49.530 --> 16:51.860
No, I've decided.

16:51.860 --> 16:52.910
This girl!

16:52.910 --> 16:53.530
Huh?

16:53.530 --> 16:53.980
ANGEL AIRBORNE SQUAD - ARIEL

16:53.980 --> 16:55.090
ANGEL AIRBORNE SQUAD - ARIEL
Ariel!

16:55.090 --> 16:56.500
ANGEL AIRBORNE SQUAD - ARIEL
That's right. It's Ariel.

16:56.500 --> 16:59.440
Yeah! She's perfect for you!

16:59.440 --> 17:01.040
Did you pick her because of her name?

17:01.040 --> 17:02.320
No, I didn't!

17:02.320 --> 17:04.610
Well, you see...

17:04.610 --> 17:06.260
What can I say...

17:06.260 --> 17:09.470
This character has the same face as me.

17:09.470 --> 17:12.430
ANGEL AIRBORNE SQUAD - ARIEL

17:13.450 --> 17:16.400
Alright, let's start with
preparing your costume!

17:16.400 --> 17:21.100
You don't need to handmake them.
You can order or custom order.

17:21.650 --> 17:24.560
I'll make it! It would be pointless
unless I make it myself!

17:25.050 --> 17:28.160
I understand!
I will do my best to help you!

17:28.160 --> 17:32.030
She gets obsessive only in certain parts.
What a weird girl.

17:32.030 --> 17:36.220
I'll give you some lessons.
So let's give our best until the next event!

17:36.220 --> 17:37.930
Yeah!

17:42.700 --> 17:45.380
I had a great time today.

17:46.390 --> 17:47.530
"The Rising Star ranking.

17:47.530 --> 17:50.840
A special award
for 20 honorable mentions"...

17:52.070 --> 17:54.320
This is... Aria?

17:54.690 --> 17:57.890
Why did she cosplay a character that
no one knows in her first event?

17:57.890 --> 18:00.420
She doesn't know much about
manga and said that she wants

18:00.420 --> 18:02.590
to get famous by cosplaying
popular characters.

18:03.210 --> 18:05.150
Was that all lies?

18:05.150 --> 18:06.420
What's going on here?

18:08.070 --> 18:11.790
It was her first time to do cosplay,
so she looked like a beginner.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.550
But her materials stood out.

18:13.550 --> 18:17.250
I asked her the name of the work,
but she didn't know much about it.

18:17.250 --> 18:19.330
Why did she cosplay such a minor character?

18:19.330 --> 18:21.830
This is from V-War for sure.

18:21.830 --> 18:25.040
It's Melia from "Valkyrie War"!
Takes me back!

18:25.510 --> 18:28.180
It was in the first
Jump Magazine I ever bought.

18:28.180 --> 18:31.210
I was in the 1st grade of elementary school.
That's about 10 years ago.

18:31.210 --> 18:33.070
It was before I fell in love with Liliel.

18:33.070 --> 18:36.020
Eh? So that means it's a very old manga, right?

18:36.020 --> 18:39.830
I really liked this manga.
I even sent out my first fan letter.

18:39.830 --> 18:40.700
Wow...

18:40.700 --> 18:42.620
But the reply...

18:42.620 --> 18:45.190
Oh? You got a reply?
That's amazing!

18:45.950 --> 18:50.110
Thank you very much
for your kind letter, Okumura.

18:50.110 --> 18:54.170
But don't tell your friends
that you like my manga.

18:54.170 --> 18:55.750
They'll bully you.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.380
What?

18:57.380 --> 18:59.030
That's rather scary...

18:59.030 --> 19:02.200
It was before I had internet,
so I didn't find out about it until later.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.010
VALKYRIE WAR

19:03.010 --> 19:07.060
V-War was axed after just 10 weeks
of serialization because of the criticism

19:07.060 --> 19:09.690
that the design and characters
imitate the Ash War Chronicle.

19:10.540 --> 19:11.670
I was just a kid.

19:11.670 --> 19:15.430
I just thought it was an interesting manga,
but it ended with only two volumes.

19:16.170 --> 19:20.310
Well, now that I think about it,
the author must have been very depressed.

19:20.310 --> 19:22.870
I still have the volumes,

19:22.870 --> 19:25.910
but I haven't opened them since
I was kinda left traumatized by it.

19:25.910 --> 19:28.380
I think I have them here.

19:28.730 --> 19:29.650
Ah, this is it.

19:29.650 --> 19:33.790
But why did Aria do cosplay
from such an old manga?

19:35.300 --> 19:36.930
Hello, guys!

19:37.710 --> 19:39.570
Huh? What's wrong?

19:41.790 --> 19:42.820
Huh?

19:43.540 --> 19:45.210
Why did you have that manga...

19:46.500 --> 19:49.420
Ah! That was from my first cosplay event!

19:49.420 --> 19:51.460
I had no clue that uncle was famous.

19:51.860 --> 19:57.150
Hey, Aria, why were you cosplaying
the old character that no one knows?

19:57.150 --> 20:00.060
If you want to be famous,
why did you choose her?

20:00.060 --> 20:02.850
And I still have so many questions about you!

20:03.190 --> 20:05.850
What's the real reason
you decided to cosplay?!

20:05.930 --> 20:08.190
No, that's a private matter.

20:09.120 --> 20:11.310
But you always get so close to other people!

20:11.310 --> 20:13.400
So why're you trying to avoid?!

20:13.910 --> 20:17.550
Just when I was starting to trust her!
This is why I can't trust a gyaru!

20:18.510 --> 20:19.740
Wait, that's not right...

20:19.740 --> 20:20.310
RUMBLE RUMBLE

20:20.310 --> 20:21.700
RUMBLE RUMBLE
Aria and I...

20:22.030 --> 20:26.210
Maybe we're having some kind of
misunderstanding, like when I was with Lilysa.

20:26.790 --> 20:29.190
I need to hear her out...

20:29.190 --> 20:32.340
Then tell her what I want to say from there.

20:34.340 --> 20:38.090
Aria, why won't you tell us?
Is it something painful?

20:38.620 --> 20:41.050
No, not really. It's just boring.

20:41.050 --> 20:44.420
Only because of that?!
But I really want to know!

20:44.910 --> 20:48.390
You see, it's important for friends
to maintain a certain distance, right?

20:48.980 --> 20:53.900
If we shared everything and tried to open up
to each other, we'd be like family.

20:53.900 --> 20:56.410
"I'll tell you about myself,
so please know me better!".

20:56.410 --> 20:59.970
That won't make a friend,
but more like a sandbag, no?

21:00.390 --> 21:04.230
Friends are for having fun, so it's good
to keep some things to ourselves.

21:06.780 --> 21:09.790
I've never thought about that...

21:10.260 --> 21:13.220
But Aria is more experienced in this...

21:13.220 --> 21:16.460
She thought about a lot
of things that I didn't...

21:17.280 --> 21:19.200
I'm glad I asked her.

21:20.090 --> 21:20.970
But...

21:21.630 --> 21:24.000
I need to tell her my feelings.

21:24.550 --> 21:25.270
Th...

21:26.530 --> 21:29.480
That might true in general, but...

21:30.170 --> 21:32.430
I've grown up with shonen manga!

21:32.430 --> 21:35.470
I believe that people who work
on something together

21:35.470 --> 21:39.140
can become friends if they open up
about their past and their feelings!

21:39.140 --> 21:41.450
Friendship is like
"Bam! This is the real me!"

21:41.910 --> 21:46.850
I want to be your friend, so if you have
a reason to do cosplay, I want to know it!

21:47.570 --> 21:49.660
Nonopi...

21:50.080 --> 21:51.760
Nonoa...

21:51.760 --> 21:53.550
Do you guys want to know too?

21:53.550 --> 21:55.330
Well, if you're fine with it.

21:55.810 --> 21:58.250
I don't mind talking about it, though.

21:58.850 --> 22:00.130
Well, you see...

22:00.130 --> 22:03.640
VALKYRIE WAR

22:07.040 --> 22:10.310
This manga was illustrated by my dad.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.830
What?!

22:14.830 --> 22:16.860
Your father is a mangaka?!

22:17.230 --> 22:18.110
THANK YOU VERY MUCH
FOR YOUR KIND LETTER, OKUMURA.

22:18.110 --> 22:19.030
BUT DON'T TELL YOUR FRIENDS THAT
YOU LIKE MY MANGA. THEY'LL BULLY YOU.

22:19.680 --> 22:22.800
The author of V-War...

23:55.080 --> 24:01.170
I WANT TO BE YOUR FRIEND
